# Real-HOME state the brokers need inside the sandbox, bound read-only at its
# own path (agent_e2e.py read_lend). The agent's own Bash is kept off the token
# by the deny rule setup.sh adds, as in a real session.
# The gh credential wrapper's GitHub App host token (git_broker, check runs).
.cache/gh-tokens/host
# github-app-mcp-server's installation listing (the github server).
.config/github-app/config
# git_broker's trustedHooksDir; it refuses to run without it.
.config/git/hooks
